{"parse": {"title": "旧雨荐选衣箱·GARMENT", "pageid": 127759, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"旧雨荐选衣箱·GARMENT\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/2a/Item-713302.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"旧雨荐选衣箱·GARMENT\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>旧雨荐选衣箱·GARMENT</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#713302</div></div><hr /><div>是你思索已久，反复观摩，却与你擦肩而过的身影，开启后可在GARMENT档位内自选一件指定范围内的衣着。若重复获得衣着，则自动转化为880粹雨滴。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">记得拾起遗落在街角的尼龙伞，这次请不要再匆匆离去。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"306603\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"衣着/快乐的捕鸟人\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"快乐的捕鸟人\"><img alt=\"快乐的捕鸟人\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Item_heroskin-306603.png/100px-Item_heroskin-306603.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Item_heroskin-306603.png/150px-Item_heroskin-306603.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Item_heroskin-306603.png/200px-Item_heroskin-306603.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%BF%AB%E4%B9%90%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%95%E9%B8%9F%E4%BA%BA\" title=\"衣着/快乐的捕鸟人\">快乐的捕鸟人</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">嘀，嘀，嘀，嘀嘀哒啦！</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"308803\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8F%A9%E9%97%A8%E7%A4%BC%E4%BB%AA\" title=\"衣着/叩门礼仪\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8F%A9%E9%97%A8%E7%A4%BC%E4%BB%AA\" title=\"叩门礼仪\"><img alt=\"叩门礼仪\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Item_heroskin-308803.png/100px-Item_heroskin-308803.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Item_heroskin-308803.png/150px-Item_heroskin-308803.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/Item_heroskin-308803.png/200px-Item_heroskin-308803.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%8F%A9%E9%97%A8%E7%A4%BC%E4%BB%AA\" title=\"衣着/叩门礼仪\">叩门礼仪</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">胜利秘诀：保持稳定，无论手指、弓弦或心。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"310203\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C\" title=\"衣着/与风暴同行\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C\" title=\"与风暴同行\"><img alt=\"与风暴同行\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Item_heroskin-310203.png/100px-Item_heroskin-310203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Item_heroskin-310203.png/150px-Item_heroskin-310203.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/88/Item_heroskin-310203.png/200px-Item_heroskin-310203.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%B8%8E%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%90%8C%E8%A1%8C\" title=\"衣着/与风暴同行\">与风暴同行</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">和动物打交道只需运用一点游侠技能，这比和人交际容易太多了。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"305303\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B8\" title=\"衣着/贝果核\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B8\" title=\"贝果核\"><img alt=\"贝果核\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Item_heroskin-305303.png/100px-Item_heroskin-305303.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Item_heroskin-305303.png/150px-Item_heroskin-305303.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Item_heroskin-305303.png/200px-Item_heroskin-305303.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E8%B4%9D%E6%9E%9C%E6%A0%B8\" title=\"衣着/贝果核\">贝果核</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">待到黄绿色与日晕重叠——你知道，就是这一刻。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"307903\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E4%BD%95%E5%9C%B0\" title=\"衣着/何时何地\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E4%BD%95%E5%9C%B0\" title=\"何时何地\"><img alt=\"何时何地\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/Item_heroskin-307903.png/100px-Item_heroskin-307903.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/Item_heroskin-307903.png/150px-Item_heroskin-307903.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/Item_heroskin-307903.png/200px-Item_heroskin-307903.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E4%BD%95%E6%97%B6%E4%BD%95%E5%9C%B0\" title=\"衣着/何时何地\">何时何地</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">历经八场阴谋，失去远方归所，他登至台前。</span></span></span></td><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"304703\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%85\" title=\"衣着/宇宙写真者\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%85\" title=\"宇宙写真者\"><img alt=\"宇宙写真者\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Item_heroskin-304703.png/100px-Item_heroskin-304703.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Item_heroskin-304703.png/150px-Item_heroskin-304703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/Item_heroskin-304703.png/200px-Item_heroskin-304703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E5%AE%87%E5%AE%99%E5%86%99%E7%9C%9F%E8%80%85\" title=\"衣着/宇宙写真者\">宇宙写真者</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">上前来，到你了！预备领受沉甸甸的勋章吧。</span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"307203\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B9\" title=\"衣着/玛瑙斯印迹\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80/%E7%8E%9B%E7%91%99%E6%96%AF%E5%8D%B0%E8%BF%B9\" title=\"玛瑙斯印迹\"><img alt=\"玛瑙斯印迹\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/Item_heroskin-307203.png/100px-Item_heroskin-307203.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"ht